  "premise": "A year after his stepsister Aika and their parents were killed, high schooler Mahiro Fuwa makes a pact with Hakaze Kusaribe, a sorceress marooned on a desert island, to find the culprit. His best friend Yoshino, secretly Aika's boyfriend, joins him against the rest of Hakaze's clan, who plan to awaken the world-ending 'Tree of Exodus'. The story draws heavily on Shakespeare's Hamlet and The Tempest, contrasting revenge with letting go. English release on Manga Up! Global.",
